Git LFS 显式空代理修复 / Honor explicitly empty Git proxy settings

基线保留插件自带的并发锁优化，不替换为未经验证的普通发行版。
Preserves the bundled concurrent-lock fork rather than replacing it with a stock release.
Source: https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs.git
Base: 35ec69f0e544a91a266ebe92ac4cf2198f61cbcd
Toolchain: Go 1.19.13, CGO_ENABLED=0
Windows binary version suffix: 35ec69f0+explicit-proxy1

在独立源码 checkout 内应用并构建；不经过 Unreal 项目构建入口。
Apply and build in an isolated source checkout; this is not an Unreal target build.
  git checkout --detach 35ec69f0e544a91a266ebe92ac4cf2198f61cbcd
  git apply --unidiff-zero <this-patch>
  go test ./lfshttp -run Proxy -count=1
  go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -X github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/v3/config.GitCommit=35ec69f0+explicit-proxy1" -o git-lfs.exe .

